Z||000001||DXR_DAD||09-28-2000||12:05 AM||||Sean, I just did my front end and sport springs. I should have bought all the parts first!!! bushings, ball joints, tie rod ends<BR>sway bar bushings and rack bushings the whole 9, if your pockets are deep enough that's the best bet. Once you get in there you'll say; I should replace that??? then its a 3 day wait to order the part?? and so on. It becomes one of those jobs that....while I have it apart I should do it right and do it once.<P>just my .02<P><BR>DXR_DAD||||reg||3
